      "scope": "Winnipeg City Hall - Selkirk - Lockport at 1 km stations across the leg boundary. Expected lengths and azimuths come from the independent standard-library oracle (quadrature theory, not pyproj); tolerances are 2 tau for lengths and 1e-8 degrees for azimuths.",
      "checks": [
